		<h4>チョコQ アニマテイルズ　日本の動物10</h4>
				<table width="100%">
		<tr><td><a href="img/ani_jap10_004.jpg">
			<img height="283" src="img/ani_jap10_004_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/anima_jap10/img/ani_jap10_004.jpg" --></a></td>
		</tr>
		</table>

